{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29793","headline":"北青萝 · 李商隐","name":"北青萝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"残阳西入崦，茅屋访孤僧。\n落叶人何在，寒云路几层。\n独敲初夜磬，闲倚一枝藤。\n世界微尘里，吾宁爱与憎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29793.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29793","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、据刘学锴《唐诗鉴赏辞典》“北青萝”条（上海辞书出版社，1983 年版）、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"据刘学锴《唐诗鉴赏辞典》“北青萝”条（上海辞书出版社，1983 年版）"}